      "options": {
        "content": "### Policy History Status\nThe current policy path now has bounded persisted sync evidence, but it is still not a full policy history system.\n\nWhat this means right now:\n- policy counts and collection health are real and useful\n- bounded static-policy detail can appear when present, but detail coverage can still be lower than the observed policy count\n- a healthy live-empty policy view is expected when no SR policies are currently observed\n- persisted policy sync age, counts, and result posture are now visible\n- richer policy drift evidence and per-policy validation history still do not yet exist, so they remain intentionally unfaked in Grafana",
